 "(2 + d/2))."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4a49a0c3-a695-46a9-a15a-0e7930769c0c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Solution", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"bc58b9be-534b-4de1-a97d-c5e078c40a13"],

Cell["\<\
Together[FunctionExpand[FRGscalarMSR`Private`directionalAverage[scal[p, q]^4, \
2, p, q, Dim] - scal[q, q]^2 Gamma[5/2] Gamma[Dim/2]/(Sqrt[Pi] Gamma[2 + \
Dim/2])]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"c69dd3aa-35d3-47b3-a93a-3920bd8dbd8b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "0: this is the k = 2 case of ",
 StyleBox["Projection.normalisation",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d8f03c19-5b57-4ef0-bfca-22b7ddf22150"]
}, Closed]],

Cell["Exercise: Integrands of the protected monomials", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"577295d2-3da9-47a6-bf92-172ae20eb271"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Which records of ",
 StyleBox["projected[\"Integrands\"]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " have a class whose flow must vanish? Are their integrands zero already? \
When does the vanishing get checked?"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ee5206dd-8032-4d85-88d2-9f9133c3dce4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Solution", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"b668e15c-ca94-40c6-bda4-4fa064cc9d20"],

Cell["\<\
{#Pair, #Frequency, #Momentum, #Class, LeafCount[#Integrand]} & /@ \
Select[projected[\"Integrands\"], MemberQ[{\"Protected\", \"Causality\", \
\"DeclaredNumeric\"}, #Class] &]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"10a7cdad-66d9-4d65-a926-093ef2b177a7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Some are already 0 (LeafCount 1), most are not: the vanishing holds only \
after the frequency integral (and, for Ward identities, sometimes only after \
the q integral). ",
 StyleBox["CheckClosure",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " (lesson 10) tests it after the frequency integration."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9ed8cac9-7ad9-48d1-9a25-497645b6f300"]
}, Closed]]
},
